  "date": "2015-08",
  "title": "Congressi Stefano Franscini Opens Call For Proposals For Conferences For 2017",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "New: ETH Summer Schools @ Monte Verità",
      "text": "Researchers and university professors working in Switzerland who would like to organise an international academic conference at Congressi Stefano Franscini at Monte Verità are invited to submit their proposal to CSF by 15 January 2016. Conferences should be three to five days in length.\n\nFrom this year, applications can be submitted for workshops as well (three days duration, 25–30 participants)."
    },
    {
      "heading": "New: ETH Summer Schools @ Monte Verità",
      "text": "Likewise, ETH Zurich researchers or professors can organise a Winter School for doctoral students at Monte Verità. The deadline for submitting the applications for 2016/2017 is 15 January 2016.\n\nFor the first time, applications can also be submitted for 2017 Summer Schools. These will receive the same financial support as Winter Schools.\n\nFor further information and the application form see the CSF website: www.csf.ethz.ch ."
    }
  ],
